
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="hi">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>Student Dashboard | Brahmastra Academy</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:#f2f4fa;font-family:Arial;color:#182448}
header{background:#14264e;color:white;padding:22px}
header h2{color:#ffd45c;margin:0}
header p{margin-bottom:0}
.container{padding:18px}
.welcome{background:white;padding:20px;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:18px}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:13px}
.card{background:white;padding:20px 12px;border-radius:12px;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 2px 8px #ddd}
.card h3{font-size:16px;color:#14264e}
.card p{font-size:13px;color:#666}
.card a{display:inline-block;background:#14264e;color:white;padding:9px 13px;border-radius:7px;text-decoration:none;font-size:13px}
footer{text-align:center;padding:20px;color:#777}
@media(max-width:350px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
<h2>BRAHMASTRA ACADEMY</h2>
<p>Student Dashboard | Rohit Sir</p>
</header>

<div class="container">
<div class="welcome">
<h2>Welcome Student!</h2>
<p>आपकी पढ़ाई, आपकी सफलता।</p>
</div>

<h3>My Learning</h3>
<div class="grid">

<div class="card">
<h3>📚 My Courses</h3>
<p>अपने कोर्स देखें</p>
<a href="courses.html">Open</a>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>🎬 Video Lectures</h3>
<p>अपनी वीडियो क्लास देखें</p>
<a href="videos.html">Open</a>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>📄 PDF Notes</h3>
<p>Study Material डाउनलोड करें</p>
<a href="notes.html">Open</a>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>📝 Online Test</h3>
<p>अपना टेस्ट दें</p>
<a href="test.html">Open</a>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>🏆 My Results</h3>
<p>टेस्ट का परिणाम देखें</p>
<a href="results.html">Open</a>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>👤 My Profile</h3>
<p>अपनी जानकारी देखें</p>
<a href="profile.html">Open</a>
</div>

</div>
</div>

<footer>
<p>© 2026 Brahmastra Academy Nagra</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
